Send the tokenization mode and the token of the transaction context in the V2 gateway update() call (IPET-3827, IPET-3857).
Only create() maps TransactionContext::$tokenizationMode and TransactionContext::$token, so a mode or a token set on a pending transaction right before its confirmation never reached wallee.

diff --git a/src/Sdk/WebServiceAPIV2/TransactionGateway.php b/src/Sdk/WebServiceAPIV2/TransactionGateway.php
index 64a81ee..160afdb 100644
--- a/src/Sdk/WebServiceAPIV2/TransactionGateway.php
+++ b/src/Sdk/WebServiceAPIV2/TransactionGateway.php
@@ -630,6 +630,14 @@ class TransactionGateway implements TransactionGatewayInterface
         if ($context->failedUrl !== null) {
             $sdkTransactionPending->setFailedUrl($context->failedUrl->value);
         }
+        // BEGIN PATCH
+        if ($context->tokenizationMode) {
+            $sdkTransactionPending->setTokenizationMode($context->tokenizationMode->value);
+        }
+        if ($context->token) {
+            $sdkTransactionPending->setToken($context->token->id);
+        }
+        // END PATCH
 
         try {
             $this->logger->debug("Gateway: Sending UPDATE request to SDK (patchPaymentTransactionsId).");
